  "webp": "lossless, exact=True",
  "bytes": 68884,
  "note": "Vinyl lettering #2B2B2B on transparent, left aligned, 48 px margins. Intro: 114 Chinese characters (4 lines), 69 English words (6 lines).",
  "colour": "#2B2B2B",
  "text_zh": "本展自馆藏中遴选十六件作品，勾勒二十世纪中叶至今的一条线索：从挥洒淋漓的姿态抽象、澄明的色域与硬边几何，到重新回望山水的水墨与矿物设色。形是结构，色是气息；二者之间，是画家一次次的取舍与试探。愿你放慢脚步，在一幅画前多停留片刻。",
  "text_en": "Between Form and Colour gathers sixteen works from the collection, tracing a path from the gestural abstraction of the 1950s through colour fields and hard-edged geometry to recent paintings that return to ink and mineral pigment. Form gives a picture its structure; colour gives it breath. Between the two lie the choices and hesitations of each painter. Take your time, and let one painting hold you a little longer."
 },
 {
  "file": "assets/gfx/text.webp",
  "source": "composed",
  "fonts": [
   "Helvetica Neue Light",
   "Helvetica Neue Regular",
   "PingFang SC Light",
