  ],
  "webp": "lossless, exact=True",
  "bytes": 41320,
  "note": "Wall text #2B2B2B on transparent, left aligned, 44 px margins. 92 Chinese characters (4 lines), 58 English words (6 lines).",
  "colour": "#2B2B2B",
  "text_zh": "看一幅画，不妨先退后几步，让整体的形与色在眼中安定下来；再慢慢走近，看笔触的方向、颜料的厚薄与画布的纹理。光线也在参与：日光缓缓移动，同一幅画会呈现不同的冷暖。请给每件作品多一点时间。",
  "text_en": "Begin from a distance and let the whole picture settle; then step closer to follow the direction of a brushstroke, the weight of the paint, the weave of the canvas. Light takes part as well: as daylight moves through the room, the same painting turns warmer or cooler. Give each work a little more time than you planned."
 },
